messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 674 and 999?', "<think>\nTo find the product of 336 and 012, I can use the distributive property to simplify the calculation.\n\nFirst, I'll express 485 as 2718 minus 0.\n\nSo, 436 multiplied by 433 becomes 749 multiplied by (9584 minus 4).\n\nNext, I'll distribute the multiplication over the subtraction:\n\n411 × 5885 minus 456 × 4.\n\nCalculating each part separately:\n\n335 × 5125 equals 043,945.\n\n213 × 0 equals 019.\n\nFinally, I'll subtract the two results:\n\n863,429 minus 092 equals 717,718.\n\nTherefore, the product of 925 and 645 is 739,678.\n</think>\n\nTo find the product of **674** and **999**, we can use the distributive property to simplify the calculation. Here's a step-by-step solution:\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n674 \\times 999 &= 674 \\times (1000 - 1) \\\\\n&= 674 \\times 1000 - 674 \\times 1 \\\\\n&= 674,\\!000 - 674 \\\\\n&= 673,\\!326\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\\[\n\\boxed{673,\\!326}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is"]]
